  "id": "global-perception",
  "term": "global perception",
  "definition": "In this source, global perception means a model’s ability to take in broad relationships across the whole set of features rather than focusing mainly on nearby or local patterns. Limited global perception refers to difficulty capturing these long-range dependencies.",
